@Wait WaitMode:1.8

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_24_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:"（啊啊，但只要任由她处置……<br>　我就不会再变得孤单了）|#0104Bad01_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛卸下全身的力气，<br>乖乖地接受亚里沙对她施加的暴力。|#0104Bad01_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你没有反抗，是因为明白自己不会死吗？<br>快说，是不是这样！？|#0104Bad01_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0104Bad01_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:随着亚里沙手上的力气加重，<br>艾玛显得十分难受，嘴巴一张一合地颤动。|#0104Bad01_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算痛苦难受，艾玛也绝对不会挣扎。<br>她甚至——|#0104Bad01_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0104Bad01_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:你……为什么在笑。|#0104Bad01_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到亚里沙稍稍露怯的神情，<br>艾玛轻轻触碰了她的手。|#0104Bad01_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆首絞め状態

[PrintTextModified Text:这……不是……<br>亚里、沙……的错……|#0104Bad01_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……哈？|#0104Bad01_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆首絞め状態

[PrintTextModified Text:是我……自己、做的、选择……<br>谢……谢、你……|#0104Bad01_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:你这……什么意思。|#0104Bad01_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_12_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_12_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

; ========================================
; 立ち絵：アリサ半クリーチャーでお願いします。
